e c’est essentiel !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_50","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":328,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":50,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":3000},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":3000,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"S60_600_Cote6'+_2","description":"Séance de seuil 60' **EN COTE** où tu vas enchaîner **3 répétitions de 6'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 5' de footing lent pour récupérer et te laisser le temps de redescendre.","displayName":"Free Solo","coachAdvice":"Déjà ta 6ᵉ séance de seuil 60, bravo pour ton parcours ! Là, ça commence à devenir sérieux. T’entraîner à rester concentré sur de longues périodes, continuer à rester connecté avec tes sensations, ce sont des qualités importantes pour un coureur.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"trail_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":328,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"S60_Cote_6","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":t