e Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Le mot d'ordre : relax ! La séance d'endurance fondamentale, c'est celle où il faut en profiter pour se détendre pour bien récupérer du fractionné. Aller trop vite sur cette séance est contre-productif, ne tombez pas dans le piège !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_20","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":325,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":0,"weekDate":1793577600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"S60_3x5_Cote_Affutage","description":"Séance de seuil 60' **EN COTE** où tu vas enchaîner **3 répétitions de 5' (dont les 3ère minutes courues à plat)** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 2' de footing lent pour récupérer et te laisser le temps de redescendre.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"Sortie intense de ta semaine. Fais en sorte d'y arriver le plus reposé(e) possible pour la valider sans soucis.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"trail_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":325,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"