ng est l'erreur la plus courante et souvent un des freins majeurs de la progression !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":325,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_45+5LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Quelques lignes droites en plus du traditionnel footing. De quoi te faire plaisir car il n'y a aucun objectif d'allure, juste de sentir que ton corps se libère et te permet d'accélérer progressivement de ligne droite en ligne droite !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":325,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":210,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":338,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":325}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":338}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":338}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":338}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":338}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":338}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"SL_80_15AC_Affutage","description":"Sortie longue d'1h20 en endurance confort avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 15' à allure course en continues","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"1h20 de sortie longue, on est sur une durée qui doit te paraître assez facile. Si jamais ça te semble un peu difficile, peut-ê